  <item>
    <title>20. 闲话消费观 ｜双11惨淡，是机制让人下头？还是消费降级？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/655a0f09c9e7cfe025d3bb86</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">655a0f09c9e7cfe025d3bb86</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 20 Nov 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你们还记得 11.11 是光棍节吗？走过了第十五个年头的双十一电商购物嘉年华，还有曾今的辉煌和疯狂吗？你还是曾经那个蹲点守候，只为抢到“史上最低价”的消费者吗？还是早已成为冷眼旁边的理智型购物达人？</span></p><span></span><p><span>双十一已过，但接下来的“黑五”，双十二，年货节，大家还有强烈的购物欲望吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期重点】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="52">00:52</a> 今年双十一，居然被京东打动了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 电商购物节的羊毛，好得靠数学功底</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="696">11:36</a> 为什么年轻一代对双十一不感兴趣了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="842">14:02</a> 攻略型消费者 vs 冲动型消费者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1332">22:12</a> 没有绝对的品牌忠诚度，产品质量才是王道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1567">26:07</a> 好的产品质量，改变了我的浪费习惯 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1851">30:51</a> 更加务实的消费观，少而精，主打一个能力范围内，尽可能买最好。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2010">33:30</a> 知识付费的陷阱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2173">36:13</a> 树立正确的消费观，拥抱延迟满足&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;BGM: Them Changes - Thundercat</span></p><span></span><p><span>*******</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎听友加入芝心姐妹听友群，期待与大家更多交流与探讨。</span></p><span></span><p><span>扫描下方二维码或直接+vx: cheese_sisters, 记得备注“听友群”哦。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhrKsshDpltNxNIS3_7TgnHZNnXM.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
